{"id":"pared","lemma":"pared","pos":"noun","rank":1020,"glosses":["wall, especially of a house or room"],"ipa":"/paˈɾed/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"paredes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pared.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta pared está muy fría.","en":"This wall feels very cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552910"},{"text":"Su habitación tiene paredes rojas.","en":"Her room has red walls.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061927"},{"text":"La pared tenía una grieta.","en":"The wall had a crack in it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639911"},{"text":"Los tubos están en las paredes.","en":"The pipes are in the walls.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578110"},{"text":"Tengo que tirar una pared.","en":"I have to knock down a wall.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509075"}]}